    "title": "娜姿的耿鬼（PGYM3）",
    "pageid": 269434,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>娜姿的耿鬼</b>（日文︰<b><span lang=\"ja\">ナツメのゲンガー</span></b>，英文︰<b>Sabrina's Gengar</b>）是一張<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\">超</a>屬性的<a href=\"/wiki/2%E9%98%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"2階進化寶可夢（TCG）\">2階進化寶可夢</a>卡。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8D.A1.E7.89.8C.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"卡牌信息\">卡牌資訊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BC%EF%BC%88PGYM3%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：卡牌資訊\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BC%EF%BC%88PGYM3%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 卡牌資訊\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"bg-超C bd-超C roundy-15 at-c a-c\" style=\"max-width:500px;width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C bgl-钢 textblack at-c\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.2em;color:initial;width:20%;white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/2%E9%98%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"2階進化寶可夢（TCG）\">2階進化</a></b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AC%BC%E6%96%AF%E9%80%9A\" title=\"鬼斯通\"><span class=\"sprite-pm sprite-icon sprite-icon-093\" title=\"鬼斯通\"></span></a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundyleft-6 roundyright-20 at-l textblack\" style=\"font-size:0.9em;height:1em;\" colspan=\"2\">從<a href=\"/wiki/Category:%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E9%AC%BC%E6%96%AF%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"Category:娜姿的鬼斯通（TCG）\">娜姿的鬼斯通</a>進化<div style=\"float:right;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">重疊於<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"宝可梦（TCG）\">精靈卡</a>上使用。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">叠放在<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"宝可梦（TCG）\">宝可梦卡</a>上使用。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">モンスターカードに重ねて使います。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>Put Sabrina's Gengar on the Stage 1 Card</small></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"border-top:2px solid #FFE57A;border-bottom:2px solid #FFE57A;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"roundybr-25 bg-魂银 bd-超C\" style=\"padding-top:6px; line-height:30px;\"><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89#娜姿的\" title=\"的寶可夢（TCG）\"><small>娜姿的</small></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BC\" title=\"耿鬼\">耿鬼</a></span></div> <div style=\"float:right;\">Lv. 42&#160;&#160;</div>\n</th>\n<td class=\"at-r va-c\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"va-c\"><b><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">HP</span><span style=\"font-size:27px;\">90</span></b></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/45px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/60px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"at-l\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">&#160;&#160;<small><span class=\"lang-zh-\">這張卡無法進化成「[[:Category:（TCG）|]]」</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">このカードは「」に進化できない</span></small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C textwhite\" style=\"background:#FFF; height:170px; border-width:3px; width:430px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/4/45/%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg/170px-%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"238\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/4/45/%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg/255px-%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/4/45/%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF%E7%9A%84%E8%80%BF%E9%AC%BCPGYM3.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"\"><small>No.094&#160;&#160;影子寶可夢：身高1.5m、體重40.5Kg&#160;&#160;</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><table class=\"a-c\" style=\"width:95%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100px;display:none;\" class=\"at-l\"><span class=\"bg-黑2 roundy-20 textwhite\"><b>&#160;&#160;招式&#160;&#160;</b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\">暗之波動</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">暗之波動</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">やみのはどう</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Dark Wave</span></b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\"><b>20</b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">在下個對手的回合結束前，雙方的所有場上寶可夢無法使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"特殊能力（TCG）\">特殊能力</a>，並且那些能力消失。。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">在下個對手的回合結束前，雙方的所有場上寶可夢無法使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"特殊能力（TCG）\">特殊能力</a>，並且那些能力消失。。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">次の相手の番の終わりまで、お互いの場にいるすべてのポケモンは、特殊能力を使うことができず、それらの力も消える。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">All Pokémon Powers stop working until the end of your opponent's next turn.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100px;display:none;\" class=\"at-l\"><span class=\"bg-黑2 roundy-20 textwhite\"><b>&#160;&#160;招式&#160;&#160;</b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\">影子束縛</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">影子束縛</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">かげしばり</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Shadow Bind</span></b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\"><b>40</b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">受到這個招式的<b>對手</b>，在對手的下個回合中不可「撤退」。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">受到這個招式的<b>對手</b>，在對手的下個回合中不可「撤退」。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">このワザを受けた<b>相手</b>は、次の相手の番に「にげる」ことができない。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">The Defending Pokémon can't retreat during your opponent's next turn.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"95%\" class=\"at-l a-c vat-c\">\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"textblack\" style=\"border-top:3px solid #000000;border-bottom:3px solid #000000;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span style=\"padding: 0px; 10px;\">━&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span></span><div style=\"float:right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%92%A4%E9%80%80%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"撤退（TCG）\">撤退</a></div>\n<table style=\"border-top:1.5px solid #000000;\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n